                <mxCell id="ta-51" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" value="&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:left;font-family:monospace;font-size:11px&#39;&gt;&lt;b style=&#39;font-family:Helvetica;font-size:13px&#39;&gt;Normalized evidence contract (app/models.py · Signal)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;id            &quot;E3&quot;  (stable within a response; cited by AI)&lt;br&gt;source        faa | nws | taf | open_meteo | sigmet&lt;br&gt;location      &quot;SFO&quot; | &quot;SFO,OAK,SJC&quot; | &quot;EN-ROUTE&quot;&lt;br&gt;category      ground_delay_program | weather_alert | aviation_forecast | …&lt;br&gt;severity      0 none · 1 low · 2 moderate · 3 high&lt;br&gt;confidence    high | medium | low&lt;br&gt;relevance     why it does / doesn&#39;t apply to this trip date&lt;br&gt;counts_toward_score   false ⇒ shown as context only&lt;br&gt;valid_from / valid_to / issued_at · url · raw (original text)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="230" width="620" x="40" y="830" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="ta-52" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;spacing=12;" value="&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:left&#39;&gt;&lt;b style=&#39;font-size:13px&#39;&gt;Before production (not in prototype)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Flight-specific data&lt;/b&gt;: airline/flight number status (FlightAware / Cirium / OAG — paid) and inbound-aircraft delay propagation; connections &amp;amp; hubs.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Calibration&lt;/b&gt;: back-test thresholds against BTS on-time / cancellation history; replace hand-tuned severities with learned probabilities.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Ops&lt;/b&gt;: shared cache (Redis), rate-limit &amp;amp; retry/backoff per source, scheduled pre-fetch, structured logging, source-freshness SLOs, alerting.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Proactive&lt;/b&gt;: ingest itineraries from the TMC/booking tool, monitor continuously, push alerts on change (Slack / email / SMS).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;AI governance&lt;/b&gt;: eval set of historical disruption days, prompt/version pinning, PII minimisation, cost/latency budgets, human review of recommendations.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Security&lt;/b&gt;: SSO, secrets manager, CORS / CSP, input limits, audit trail of what each traveler was told and why.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Coverage&lt;/b&gt;: ground transport &amp;amp; rail (Amtrak), hotels, civil events/strikes, TSA wait times, international.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="230" width="960" x="700" y="830" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
